ix $Σ$ given by\n$μ = \\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}, Σ = \\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 4\\end{bmatrix}$.\n\nLet $Y = X_{1} - 2X_{2}$. Calculate $P(Y \\ge 1)$.\n\n*Hint: A table of values of $Φ(z)$ for different values of $z$ is given below, where $Φ(z)$ is the cumulative distribution function for the standard normal distribution.*\n\n| $z$ | $0.03$ | $0.04$ | $0.05$ |\n| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: |\n| $0.8$ | $0.7967$ | $0.7995$ | $0.8023$ |\n| $0.9$ | $0.8238$ | $0.8264$ | $0.8289$ |\n| $1.0$ | $0.8485$ | $0.8508$ | $0.8531$ |\n\n> A scientific calculator is required to answer this question." :question/requires-calculator true}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186092581 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186092332 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "0e2025f8-a9cf-5e30-bb03-4909aefdd7e2" :knowledge-point/title "Linear Combinations of Elements From a Multivariate Normal Random Variable"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a20292c9-1982-585c-be36-9420091bb57e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0.3300" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186089658} {:answer/id #uuid "a5e8eb56-0371-5757-8469-9c0697832e0c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0.2810" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186089659} {:answer/id #uuid "b73494d1-fc66-51a2-9f26-71a8c9140462" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0.2401" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186089660} {:answer/id #uuid "bc1516df-74a2-5d5b-89ee-857bc7a12a70" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0.3062" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186089661} {:answer/id #uuid "1e0330de-9644-59fe-8b6a-f5a8dcc656bb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0.3783" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186089662}] :answer-field/id #uuid "63118e31-c8a5-57cd-b21b-61395ca13c09" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {